Executor on WSL supports terminal and filesystem control inside the Linux environment.

Desktop control requires the Windows companion because GUI automation does not cross the WSL boundary reliably.

Use the Windows companion for:
- broker and desktop helper installation
- Cloudflare Tunnel service registration on Windows
- startup registration for the active Windows user

Use WSL for:
- executor agent runtime
- local config and data at {{ .DataDir }}
- cloudflared config generation that points to 127.0.0.1
